{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LdDZfokcJY1793140432.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>油價持續回軟，金價繼續反彈。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報4,074.6美元一盎司，升36.2美元，升幅近百分之0.9。美國聯邦儲備局公布議息結果前，現貨金價一度高見4,065.73美元，升49.02美元，升幅百分之1.2。</p><p></p><p>Zaner Metals副總裁兼高級金屬策略師格蘭特認為，油價轉趨疲弱，可能為金價帶來一定支持，因為通脹憂慮紓緩，某程度可令聯儲局的鷹派立場緩和。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T23:14:15.037764+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:38:44.463137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:52.167858+00:00","content_hash":"ddfb9d014f2090d9deea4a9bc92fa6558e742feb663a1ca40750e00b06cbf4b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T23:14:15.037764+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}